  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/can1357/oh-my-pi/tarball/v18.2.11",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/can1357/oh-my-pi/zipball/v18.2.11",
  "body": "## @oh-my-pi/pi-agent-core\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Fixed background job completions interrupting foreground Bash and eval calls, which could cause those calls to be repeatedly moved into the background.\n\n## @oh-my-pi/pi-ai\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Fixed Claude Opus 5.5 not applying a mid-session switch to high-effort reasoning when the session started without an explicit effort setting.\n- Fixed Alibaba Token Plan monthly quotas not appearing in usage reports or the status line.\n\n## @oh-my-pi/pi-catalog\n\n### Added\n\n- Added built-in StepFun provider support for the step-5-preview model, including live model discovery.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Fixed cost estimation for OpenAI Codex GPT-6 Sol and Luna models across standard and worker routes.\n- Fixed GitHub Copilot Grok 4.x models failing to make requests.\n\n## @oh-my-pi/pi-coding-agent\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Fixed nested `eval` Todo updates not being reflected by the Todo tracker, including cases where a cell fails after committing an update.\n- Fixed strict-mode structured-output validation for JSON Schemas without a root `type`, preserving their `items` and `required` keywords.\n- Improved streamed TTSR whole-buffer matching to avoid repeated scans from the beginning of the buffer.\n- Fixed plural browser queries when compiled binaries provide shallow stack traces.\n- Fixed browser `tab.fill` timing out on pages whose animation frames stall.\n- Fixed the first LSP diagnostics request returning no results while a newly started language server is still analyzing.\n- `/shake thinking` now reports the number of tokens freed.\n\n## @oh-my-pi/pi-natives\n\n### Changed\n\n- Improved `warmHighlighter()` so it prepares TypeScript, TSX, JavaScript, Bash, Python, Rust, and Markdown highlighting in the background, reducing delays on the first highlight for these languages.\n\n## @oh-my-pi/pi-tui\n\n### Added\n\n- Added a Skills section to the settings.\n- Enabled OSC 8 hyperlinks in rio.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Fixed scrolling startup release notes without requiring an initial Escape keypress.\n- Improved usage quota display so names remain distinguishable and readable in narrow and multi-column dashboards.\n\n## @oh-my-pi/pi-wire\n\n### Added\n\n- Added public API contract and authentication schemas for the Skillshare registry.\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix(coding-agent/tools): keep native JSON Schema roots out of JTD conversion by @roboomp in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12896\n* fix(browser): drive tab.fill and frame actions off puppeteer Locator by @roboomp in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12898\n* Add Pi-compatible RPC primitives get_entries(since), get_tree, get_available_thinking_levels to RPC protocol by @44madfire in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12900\n* fix(browser): tolerate missing Puppeteer callsites by @Dante-dan in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12902\n* fix(tui): preserve distinguishing usage quota labels by @lockwo in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12903\n* fix(coding-agent): explain model fallback causes by @lockwo in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12904\n* fix(catalog): route Copilot Grok 4.x through the Responses API by @roboomp in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12905\n* fix(tui): make startup changelog scrollable after welcome animation by @michaelr in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12906\n* feat(coding-agent): expose before_subagent_spawn hook for extensions by @aloyzzz in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12907\n* fix(coding-agent): report tokens freed by /shake thinking by @Gablinas in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12916\n* feat(catalog): added StepFun provider with live model discovery by @ArpitMishra17 in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12918\n* fix(todo): refresh tracker after nested eval updates by @tommymorgan in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12921\n* feat(tui): enable OSC 8 hyperlinks on rio by @abcfy2 in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12922\n* feat(coding-agent): configure extended context for custom providers by @LingLambda in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12923\n* fix(agent): stopped background completions from cascading auto-backgrounding by @roboomp in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12874\n* fix(usage): show Alibaba Token Plan monthly quotas by @roboomp in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12877\n* fix(codex): update client version for GPT-6 models by @itsddvn in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12885\n* perf(coding-agent): avoid repeated whole-buffer TTSR scans by @Dante-dan in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12887\n* fix(lsp): deferred provisional cold diagnostics by @roboomp in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12890\n* fix(natives): drop the stale minimizer filter generator from pi-natives by @STRML in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12891\n* docs: documented OTLP exporter request header env variables by @roboomp in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12897\n\n## New Contributors\n* @44madfire made their first contribution in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12900\n* @lockwo made their first contribution in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12903\n* @michaelr made their first contribution in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12906\n* @aloyzzz made their first contribution in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12907\n* @Gablinas made their first contribution in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12916\n* @ArpitMishra17 made their first contribution in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12918\n* @tommymorgan made their first contribution in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12921\n* @abcfy2 made their first contribution in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12922\n* @LingLambda made their first contribution in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12923\n* @itsddvn made their first contribution in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/12885\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/compare/v18.2.10...v18.2.11",
